Fun. Fast paced. Heavier emphasis on skill. Can be hard to find matches at weird hours. Zero Gravity!
is a fantastic game. Though some matches can run a bit long for a shooter (
) they're still fun and intense, win or lose. Despite there being 9 classes some end up falling into 'roles' and feeling a bit similar (
