An awesome stealth game. There are a few points that I want to make here:
*The level design is just perfect (you have multiple paths, each one is as good as the others, and one way or the other, you'll finish the level);
*Mark of the Ninja is a stealth game, but, unlike others, you get rewards for both being stealthy, or being a killing machine, I like that;
* and finally, every artistic element of the game is gorgeous.
One problem?, the game sometimes has trouble diferenciating between 2 overlapped actions. Still, a very good purchase. Highly recommended if you like the genre, or want to try it for the first time

